OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome early
OL,6,Fevening sunshine in the east, though
OL,7,Frather cloudy elsewhere with a brisk
OL,8,Fwind. Cloud thickening overnight
OL,9,Fbringing some hill fog and patchy
OL,10,Flight rain. Staying warm and humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy and damp
OL,13,Fmorning with some mostly light rain.
OL,14,FBrightening up from the northwest
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon to leave a fine
OL,16,Fevening. Breezy, and turning fresher
OL,17,Fthan recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
