OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday looks dry with some sunshine
OL,7,Fand gentle winds. Turning windy from
OL,8,Fthe northwest on Sunday with some rain
OL,9,Farriving later, ahead of brighter
OL,10,Fskies again on Monday.
